# Client-supplied credentials - never commit.
# Everything the client sends goes in credentials/ so a new file cannot be
# swept in by `git add -A` before anyone thinks about it.
credentials/
docs/Updates.txt
docs/Resend*.txt
**/credentials*.txt
**/secrets*.txt
**/*api*key*.txt
**/*API*Key*.txt
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
